  m_text: 'VERDGE


    Made by Please, Let Me Cook! studios


    Main Idea - basic_eagles

    Game
    & Level Design - Arkasha

    Code - sSakuray

    3D Models - HANDLER

    2D
    Art & Visual - basic_eagles

    Music - Vbuh

    Sound Design - Freesound.org


    Speacial
    thanks to:

    Neonoire, Partiza


    Tracks used:

    Haremorrhage - Vbuh

    Heart
    Ripper  - Vbuh

    MAELSTORM  - Vbuh

    Reconstructed Ragdoll  - Vbuh

    Strip
    Club Massacre  - Vbuh

    Verdge of Bursting  - Vbuh

    Vessel to be Fueled 
    - Vbuh


    Freesound credits:

    Door Smash 1 by qubodup -- https://freesound.org/s/218890/
    -- License: Creative Commons 0


    Brick-Drop-Concrete-06.wav by DWOBoyle --
    https://freesound.org/s/145695/ -- License: Attribution 4.0


    Alarm3.wav
    by Rotaredom -- https://freesound.org/s/686861/ -- License: Creative Commons
    0


    switching_a_rattling_lever_with_room_ambience.wav by mediatheksuche --
    https://freesound.org/s/623712/ -- License: Creative Commons 0


    wind draft
    loop 3 by nsstudios -- https://freesound.org/s/651545/ -- License: Attribution
    4.0


    metalbarrelkick_02.wav by sarana -- https://freesound.org/s/83180/
    -- License: Attribution 4.0


    Click by complex_waveform -- https://freesound.org/s/213148/
    -- License: Attribution 4.0


    -----------------------------


    And special
    thanks you for playing VERDGE!

'
